* "Should we run a full iron panel or other specific labs to monitor my anemia as I finish the Prednisone taper?"
* "Given my age and heart failure history, am I up to date on recommended vaccines (such as RSV, Shingles, Pneumococcal, or updated Flu/COVID)?"

