*   *Creatinine Levels:* "My last creatinine level was 110. How does this kidney function level affect my heart failure management and the clearance of my current medications?"
*   *Follow-up Labs:* "Do we need to run a new metabolic panel today to check my current creatinine and electrolyte levels?"

